// A world's requirement names a theory, refused where it names none.
//
// A role's requirement must name a signature that a site's offer can model.
//
// `world w requires R ;` states as a theory what a role at `w` needs of its
// site. A requirement naming no theory is refused at the world, by the name
// it gives.
//
// - see: `corpus/model/deployments/offers.gandr` — a world requiring `Store`

/// A world requiring a theory nothing declares.
@[ refuses("UnresolvedTypeHead") ]
pub world lost requires Missing;
